{% comment %}
  BAH — Collapsible Content (FAQ) — Usage & Data Format

  What it does
  ------------
  Renders an accordion list. It pulls JSON items FIRST, then appends any items you add via Theme Editor block settings.

  Where the data comes from
  -------------------------
  A) Product JSON metafield
     - Namespace: custom
     - Key: product_collapsible_content
     - Type: JSON
     - Value follows the “Sample JSON” below

  B) Metaobject with a JSON field
     - Create a metaobject record that has a JSON field named "json_schema"
     - Set product.metafields.custom.product_collapsible_content to REFERENCE that metaobject
     - The snippet reads in this order: mf.value.json_schema → mf.json_schema → mf.value → mf

  JSON fields this snippet understands
  ------------------------------------
  {
    "is_show": true|false,             // If false, nothing renders. Falls back to block.settings.is_show if missing.
    "items": [
      {
        "title":   "Row heading",      // Shown in the accordion header (required to render, or provide 'content')
        "content": "HTML or text",     // Shown inside the panel body (HTML allowed)
        "icon":    "⭐ or e873",        // Optional; emoji OR hex codepoint. If present, it takes priority over image
        "image":   "filename.png"      // Optional; filename from Settings → Files, or a full URL. Used when icon is blank
      }
    ]
  }

  Priority & rendering rules
  --------------------------
  - Icon wins over image. If icon is blank and image is present, show image.
  - Item is rendered when either "title" or "content" is non-empty.
  - Hex icons: accept "e873", "#e873", "0xE873", "U+E873", "&#xE873;" — the code normalizes them.
    They render via 'Material Icons' / 'Material Symbols' stacks. Ensure that font is available on your theme if you use hex codepoints.
  - Images: if using a filename (recommended), upload it in Settings → Files and store only the filename (e.g., "sample.png").
    Full URLs also work.

  Block settings that affect the render
  -------------------------------------
  - font_size (header/body text), text_color
  - emoji_size (icon/image square size), emoji_color (icon color)
  - Plus your existing t1..t10 / c1..c10 / icon1..icon10 / image1..image10 fields (these are appended AFTER JSON items)

  Behavior & a11y
  ---------------
  - Click header to toggle. Only one panel stays open (siblings close automatically).
  - Header has aria-controls set; JS toggles 'aria-expanded'. (Optional: add role="button" and tabindex for full keyboard semantics.)

  Troubleshooting
  ---------------
  - Nothing appears? Ensure is_show is true (or the block setting is enabled) AND at least one JSON/block item has title or content.
  - Hex icon not visible? Verify your icon font is loaded and the codepoint exists.
  - Image not visible? Check the filename in Settings → Files or try a full URL.

  Sample JSON (put this into your metafield value)
  ---------------
  {
    "is_show": true,
    "items": [
      { "title": "Sample with Image",     "content": "Sample Content", "image": "sample.png" },
      { "title": "Sample with Icon",      "content": "Sample Content", "icon": "⭐" },
      { "title": "Sample with HEX Icon",  "content": "Sample Content", "icon": "e873" }
    ]
  }
{% endcomment %}

{% style %}
  .accordion { margin-left: 0 !important; margin-right: 0 !important;}

  /* Row divider */
  .faq-accordion .faqs-main {
    position: relative;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), 0.16);
  }
  .faq-accordion .faqs-main:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  /* GPU-friendly underline bar on active */
  .faq-accordion .faqs-main::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -1px;
    left: 0;
    height: 3px;
    width: 200px;
    background: #222222;
    transform: scaleX(0);
    transform-origin: left;
    transition: transform 1s ease;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .faq-accordion .faqs-main.active::before { transform: scaleX(1); }

  /* Header row */
  .faq-accordion .panel-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: left;
    background: transparent;
    border: 0;
    padding: 1.4rem 0;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color 0.25s ease;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  /* Caret on the right; rotate when open */
  .faq-accordion .panel-header .caret-icon {
    margin-left: auto;
    transition: transform var(--duration-short, 150ms) ease;
  }
  .faq-accordion .panel-header[aria-expanded="true"] .caret-icon { transform: rotate(90deg); }

  /* Animated collapse */
  .faq-accordion .collapse {
    overflow: hidden;
    max-height: 0;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: max-height 300ms ease, opacity 240ms ease;
  }
  .faq-accordion .collapse.show { opacity: 1; /* max-height set inline by JS */ }

  .faq-accordion .item-content {
    padding: 0 0 1.4rem 0;
    font-size: 16px !important;
    border: none !important;
  }
{% endstyle %}

{% for block in section.blocks %}
  <div class="accordion faq-accordion" id="Accordion-{{ section.id | append: forloop.index }}"
  style="margin-top: {{ block.settings.margin_top | default: 0 }}px; margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.margin_bottom | default: 0 }}px;"
  >
    {% if block.type == 'bah-collapsible-content' %}
      {%- assign mo = null -%}
      {%- assign mf = product.metafields.custom.product_collapsible_content -%}

      {%- if mf != blank -%}
        {%- if mf.type contains 'metaobject' -%}
          {%- assign mo = mf.value -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%} Normalize into variables {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign is_show = true -%}
      {%- assign items = '' | split: ',' -%}

      {%- if mo -%}
        {%- assign cfg = mf.value.json_schema | default: mf.json_schema | default: mf.value | default: mf -%}

        {%- assign is_show = cfg.value.is_show -%}
        {%- if is_show == null -%}
          {%- assign is_show = block.settings.is_show -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if is_show != true and is_show != false and is_show != null -%}
          {%- assign v = is_show | downcase | strip -%}
          {%- if v == 'true' or v == '1' or v == 'yes' or v == 'y' -%}
            {%- assign is_show = true -%}
          {%- else -%}
            {%- assign is_show = false -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- assign items = cfg.value.items -%}
        {%- if items == null or items == '' -%}
          {%- assign items = '' | split: ',' -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}

      {% if is_show %}
        {%- assign text_sz = block.settings.font_size | default: 14 -%}
        {%- assign text_col = block.settings.text_color | default: '#000' -%}
        {%- assign icon_col = block.settings.emoji_color | default: '#000' -%}
        {%- assign icon_px = block.settings.emoji_size | default: 18 -%}
        {%- assign retina_w = icon_px | times: 2 -%}
        {%- assign size1x = icon_px | append: 'x' -%}
        {%- assign size2x = retina_w | append: 'x' -%}

        {%- comment -%} 1) Collect JSON items + block settings items into one array (as delimited rows) {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- assign combined = '' | split: ',' -%}
        {%- assign sep = '|||~SEP~|||' -%}
        {%- assign mk_single = '|||~SINGLE~|||' -%}

        {%- comment -%} 1a) JSON items (title/content/icon/image) {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- assign json_items = '' -%}
        {%- if items -%}
          {%- assign json_items = items -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {% if json_items != '' %}
          {% for it in json_items %}
            {% assign t = it.title | default: '' | strip %}
            {% assign c = it.content | default: '' %}
            {% assign ic = it.icon | default: '' | strip %}
            {% assign im = it.image | default: '' | strip %}

            {% if t != '' or c != '' %}
              {% assign img1x = '' -%}
              {%- assign img2x = '' %}
              {% if im != '' %}
                {% if im contains '://' %}
                  {% assign img1x = im -%}
                  {%- assign img2x = im %}
                {% else %}
                  {% assign img1x = im | file_img_url: size1x %}
                  {% assign img2x = im | file_img_url: size2x %}
                {% endif %}
              {% endif %}

              {% capture row %}{{ t | replace: sep, '' }}{{ sep }}{{ c | replace: sep, '' }}{{ sep }}{{ ic | replace: sep, '' }}{{ sep }}{{ img1x }}{{ sep }}{{ img2x }}{% endcapture %}
              {% assign single = row | split: mk_single %}
              {% assign combined = combined | concat: single %}
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        {% endif %}

        {%- comment -%} 1b) Theme Editor items (t1..t10 / c1..c10 / icon1..icon10 / image1..image10) {%- endcomment -%}
        {% for i in (1..10) %}
          {% assign t_id = 't' | append: i %}
          {% assign c_id = 'c' | append: i %}
          {% assign i_id = 'icon' | append: i %}
          {% assign m_id = 'image' | append: i %}

          {% assign t = block.settings[t_id] | default: '' | strip %}
          {% assign c = block.settings[c_id] | default: '' %}
          {% assign ic = block.settings[i_id] | default: '' | strip %}
          {% assign im = block.settings[m_id] %}

          {% if t != '' or c != '' %}
            {% assign img1x = '' -%}
            {%- assign img2x = '' %}
            {% if im != blank %}
              {% assign img1x = im | image_url: width: icon_px %}
              {% assign img2x = im | image_url: width: retina_w %}
            {% endif %}

            {% capture row %}{{ t | replace: sep, '' }}{{ sep }}{{ c | replace: sep, '' }}{{ sep }}{{ ic | replace: sep, '' }}{{ sep }}{{ img1x }}{{ sep }}{{ img2x }}{% endcapture %}
            {% assign single = row | split: mk_single %}
            {% assign combined = combined | concat: single %}
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}

        {%- comment -%} 2) Render ONCE from unified `combined` {%- endcomment -%}
        {% for row in combined %}
          {% assign parts = row | split: sep %}
          {% assign q = parts[0] | default: '' | strip %}
          {% assign a = parts[1] | default: '' %}
          {% assign icon = parts[2] | default: '' | strip %}
          {% assign img1x = parts[3] | default: '' | strip %}
          {% assign img2x = parts[4] | default: '' | strip %}

          {% if q != '' or a != '' %}
            {% assign uid = section.id | append: '-u-' | append: block.id | append: '-' | append: forloop.index %}

            <div class="faqs-main" style="font-size: {{ block.settings.font_size | default: 16 }}px; ">
              <div class="panel-group">
                <div class="panel-header" aria-controls="faq-{{ uid }}" data-target="#faq-{{ uid }}">
                  {%- comment -%} ICON first, else image (retina-ready) {%- endcomment -%}
                  {% if icon != '' %}
                    {%- assign norm = icon
                      | downcase
                      | remove: 'u+'
                      | remove: '0x'
                      | remove: '&#x'
                      | remove: '&#'
                      | remove: ';'
                      | strip
                    -%}
                    {%- assign HEX = norm | upcase -%}
                    {%- assign clean = HEX
                      | remove: '0'
                      | remove: '1'
                      | remove: '2'
                      | remove: '3'
                      | remove: '4'
                      | remove: '5'
                      | remove: '6'
                      | remove: '7'
                      | remove: '8'
                      | remove: '9'
                      | remove: 'A'
                      | remove: 'B'
                      | remove: 'C'
                      | remove: 'D'
                      | remove: 'E'
                      | remove: 'F'
                    -%}
                    {%- assign is_hex = false -%}
                    {% if HEX != '' and clean == '' %}{%- assign is_hex = true -%}{% endif %}

                    {% if is_hex %}
                      <span
                        aria-hidden="true"
                        style="font-family:'Material Icons','Material Icons Round','Material Icons Outlined','Material Symbols Outlined',sans-serif; color:{{ icon_col }}; font-size:{{ icon_px }}px; line-height:1; display:inline-block;"
                      >
                        {{ '&#x' | append: HEX | append: ';' }}
                      </span>
                    {% else %}
                      <span
                        aria-hidden="true"
                        style="font-family:'Apple Color Emoji','Segoe UI Emoji','Noto Color Emoji','Noto Emoji','EmojiOne Color','Twemoji Mozilla',system-ui,sans-serif; font-size:{{ icon_px }}px; line-height:1; display:inline-block;"
                      >
                        {{ icon }}
                      </span>
                    {% endif %}
                  {% elsif img1x != '' or img2x != '' %}
                    {% assign img_src = img2x | default: img1x %}
                    <img
                      src="{{ img_src | escape }}"
                      {% if img1x != '' and img2x != '' %}
                        srcset="{{ img1x | escape }} 1x, {{ img2x | escape }} 2x"
                      {% endif %}
                      alt=""
                      class="faq-icon img"
                      width="{{ icon_px }}"
                      height="{{ icon_px }}"
                      loading="lazy"
                    >
                  {% endif %}

                  <span style="font-size:{{ text_sz }}px; color:{{ text_col }}; line-height:1.3; padding-left: 10px;">
                    {{- q -}}
                  </span>

                  <span class="caret-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg class="icon-accordion" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20" height="20">
                      <path fill-rule="evenodd"
                        d="M7.5 5.5a.75.75 0 011.06 0l4 4a.75.75 0 010 1.06l-4 4a.75.75 0 11-1.06-1.06L10.44 10 7.5 7.06a.75.75 0 010-1.56z"
                        clip-rule="evenodd" />
                    </svg>
                  </span>
                </div>

                <div class="panel-body">
                  <div id="faq-{{ uid }}" class="collapse" data-parent="#Accordion-{{ section.id }}">
                    <div class="item-content rte" style="padding: 0 0 20px 0">
                      {{ a }}
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      {% endif %}
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  <script>
    (function () {
      var root = document.getElementById('Accordion-{{ section.id | append: forloop.index }}');
      if (!root) return;

      // Initialize max-heights for smooth animation
      root.querySelectorAll('.collapse').forEach(function (el) {
        el.style.maxHeight = el.classList.contains('show') ? el.scrollHeight + 'px' : '0px';
      });

      function openPanel(panel, header) {
        var main = header.closest('.faqs-main');
        panel.classList.add('show');
        panel.style.maxHeight = panel.scrollHeight + 'px';
        if (main) main.classList.add('active');
      }

      function closePanel(panel, header) {
        var main = header.closest('.faqs-main');
        panel.style.maxHeight = panel.scrollHeight + 'px';
        requestAnimationFrame(function () {
          panel.style.maxHeight = '0px';
          panel.addEventListener('transitionend', function handler() {
            panel.classList.remove('show');
            if (main) main.classList.remove('active');
            panel.removeEventListener('transitionend', handler);
          });
        });
      }

      function closeSiblings(except) {
        root.querySelectorAll('.collapse.show').forEach(function (openEl) {
          if (openEl !== except) {
            var head = root.querySelector('.panel-header[data-target="#' + openEl.id + '"]');
            closePanel(openEl, head);
            if (head) head.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
          }
        });
      }

      root.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
        var btn = e.target.closest('.panel-header');
        if (!btn) return;

        var targetSel = btn.getAttribute('data-target');
        var panel = root.querySelector(targetSel);
        if (!panel) return;

        var isOpen = panel.classList.contains('show');

        if (isOpen) {
          btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
          closePanel(panel, btn);
        } else {
          closeSiblings(panel);
          btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');
          openPanel(panel, btn);
        }
      });

      document.addEventListener('shopify:section:load', function (e) {
        if (e.detail && e.detail.sectionId === '{{ section.id }}') {
          root.querySelectorAll('.collapse').forEach(function (el) {
            el.style.maxHeight = el.classList.contains('show') ? el.scrollHeight + 'px' : '0px';
          });
        }
      });
    })();
  </script>
{% endfor %}
